<Base title="Website privacy" description="How this Roost product and documentation website handles information."><main id="main" class="container legal-page"><span class="small-label">PLAIN AND SIMPLE</span><h1>Website <em>privacy.</em></h1><p>This is the Roost product and documentation website, maintained by MSR Builds. It does not offer community accounts, collect payment details, or include advertising trackers or analytics scripts.</p><h2>Documentation search</h2><p>Search runs in your browser against a static index downloaded from this website. We do not send your search terms to a search service.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The hosting provider processes requests to deliver pages and protect the service. Technical information such as IP addresses may appear in its operational logs. This website does not set application cookies.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Links to GitHub, MSR Builds, and infrastructure providers take you to services with their own privacy practices. Roost communities installed by other operators are managed by those operators and are separate from this website.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact the project through <a href="https://github.com/msrbuilds/roost/issues">the Roost repository</a>. Please do not post credentials or private community information in a public issue.</p></main></Base>
